# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Security Code Clustering (v4)

This document applies the **(Endpoint, Sink) dataflow-based clustering strategy v4** to the {{PROJECT_NAME}} codebase. It complements the existing architecture review by regrouping and augmenting scenario-based findings through cluster analysis.

## 1. Purpose and Principles

- **Purpose**: Reduce analysis cost and improve consistency by grouping repetitive security patterns into representative-sample reviews (v4 section 10)
- **Principle** (v4 section 1): "A cluster does not guarantee identical results. A cluster provides the possibility of applying the same review strategy."
- **Unit** (v4 section 4): `(Endpoint, Sink)` source-to-sink dataflow path
- **Essence** (v4 section 10): "Cluster security-meaningful flows, not code."

